 "section_summary": "This section contains the concluding pages of the Akita Prefecture portion of a comprehensive roster of Japanese educational institutions compiled in 1946. It finishes the survey of public elementary schools with institutional data, founding dates, and comparative enrollment and teacher statistics as of April 30 and November 30, 1946. The roster also catalogs private secondary vocational schools, girls' high schools, youth schools, and kindergartens, as well as vocational and youth training institutes operated under non-educational government ministries (Home Ministry, Ministry of Transportation, and Ministry of Communications) and a juvenile correction school under the Ministry of Welfare.",
